GEODATABASE_FILE_6_TRANSACTION_INTERVAL "$(GEODATABASE_FILE_OUT_TRANSACTION_INTERVAL_GEODATABASE_FILE_6)"
GUI OPTIONAL INTEGER GEODATABASE_FILE_OUT_TRANSACTION_INTERVAL_GEODATABASE_FILE_6 Features Per Transaction
# ============================================================================
# Determines whether to continue the translation, despite having encountered
# a feature that would normally stop the translation.
